                 88  SW-Use-Fin-Inst                Value 'F'.          01150000
               10  SW-CC-Contract-Type   Pic  X(01).                    01160000
                 88  SW-Use-Contract-Type           Value 'T'.          01170000
               10  SW-CC-Contract-No     Pic  X(01).                    01180000
                 88  SW-Use-Contract-No             Value 'N'.          01190000
               10  SW-CC-Part-Amount     Pic  X(01).                    01200000
