           05  W-DB-Key.                                                01370000
               10  W-DB-Fin-Inst-ID      Pic S9(18)              Comp-3.01380000
               10  W-DB-Contract-Type    Pic  X(03).                    01390000
               10  W-DB-Contract-No      Pic S9(07)              Comp-3.01400000
               10  W-DB-CA-Currency      Pic  X(03).                    01410000
               10  W-DB-From-PA-Seq-No   Pic S9(04)              Comp.  01420000
               10  W-DB-To-PA-Seq-No     Pic S9(04)              Comp.  01430000
               10  W-DB-Status           Pic  X(12).                    01440000
      *                                                                 01450000
      *----------------------------------------------------------------*01460000
      * These fields are used for comparison with the WS-fields.        01470000
      *                                                                 01480000
           05  WE-Cursor-Info.                                          01490000
             07  WE-Key.                                                01500000
               10  WE-Fin-Inst-ID        Pic S9(18)              Comp-3.01510000
               10  WE-Fin-Inst-No        Pic  X(18).                    01520000
               10  WE-Contract-Type      Pic  X(03).                    01530000
               10  WE-Contract-No        Pic S9(07)              Comp-3.01540000
               10  WE-CA-Currency        Pic  X(03).                    01550000
               10  WE-From-PA-Seq-No     Pic S9(04)              Comp.  01560000
               10  WE-To-PA-Seq-No       Pic S9(04)              Comp.  01570000
               10  WE-Status             Pic  X(12).                    01580000
             07  WE-Code-Sequence        Pic  X(01).                    01590000
               88  WE-CS-Ascending                  Value 'A'.          01600000
               88  WE-CS-Descending                 Value 'D'.          01610000
      *                                                                 01620000
      *----------------------------------------------------------------*01630000
      * Storage, and switches for identifying the content:              01640000
      * The cursor info is used to verify that the get-next has the     01650000
      * same qualification as the get-1st.                              01660000
      *                                                                 01670000
       01  W-Storage.                                                   01680000
      *                                                                 01690000
           05  WS-Cursor-Info.                                          01700000
             07  WS-Key.                                                01710000
               10  WS-Fin-Inst-ID        Pic S9(18)              Comp-3.01720000
               10  WS-Fin-Inst-No        Pic  X(18).                    01730000
               10  WS-Contract-Type      Pic  X(03).                    01740000
               10  WS-Contract-No        Pic S9(07)              Comp-3.01750000
               10  WS-CA-Currency        Pic  X(03).                    01760000
               10  WS-From-PA-Seq-No     Pic S9(04)              Comp.  01770000
               10  WS-To-PA-Seq-No       Pic S9(04)              Comp.  01780000
               10  WS-Status             Pic  X(12).                    01790000
             07  WS-Code-Sequence        Pic  X(01).                    01800000
               88  WS-CS-Ascending                  Value 'A'.          01810000
               88  WS-CS-Descending                 Value 'D'.          01820000
             07  WS-Cursor-Status        Pic  X(08).                    01830000
               88  WS-Cursor-OK                     Value 'OK'.         01840000
               88  WS-Cursor-End                    Value 'END'.        01850000
      *                                                                 01860000
      * We store all occurences that are read, also those that we do    01870000
      * not find. This is to reduce the number of DB2 accesses.         01880000
      *                                                                 01890000
           05  WS-DB2-Table.                                            01900000
             07  WS-DB2-Row              Occurs 10 Times.               01910000
               10  WS-DB2-Tbl-Version    Pic  X(16).                    01920000
               10  WS-DB2-Fin-Inst-ID    Pic S9(18)              Comp-3.01930000
               10  WS-DB2-Contract-Type  Pic  X(03).                    01940000
               10  WS-DB2-Contract-No    Pic S9(07)              Comp-3.01950000
               10  WS-DB2-CA-Currency    Pic  X(03).                    01960000
               10  WS-DB2-PA-Seq-No      Pic S9(04)              Comp.  01970000
               10  WS-DB2-Row-Status     Pic S9(01)              Comp-3.01980000
                 88  WS-DB2-Not-Read                Value +0.           01990000
                 88  WS-DB2-Read                    Value +1.           02000000
                 88  WS-DB2-Not-Found               Value +2.           02010000
               10  WS-DB2-DCL            Pic  X(250).                   02020000
