      *################################################################.07840000
       G100-Move-Input-To-DCL            Section.                       07850000
      *                                                                 07860000
      * PLEASE REMEMBER:                                                07870000
      *    When you modify the code in this section, you need to do     07880000
      *    the same modifications in module F115APA0 - E200-section.    07890000
      *                                                                 07900000
           Initialize                          DCLTF-Part-Amount        07910000
      *                                                                 07920000
           Move R115IPA0-Fin-Inst-ID     To    FK-OAKO-FinInst-ID       07930000
           If  R115IPA0-Fin-Inst-No      Not = Space                    07940000
           and R115IPA0-Fin-Inst-ID      =     +0                       07950000
               Move  R115IPA0-Fin-Inst-No                               07960000
                                         To    W-Fin-Inst-No            07970000
               Perform N100-Fetch-Fin-Inst-ID                           07980000
               Move  W-Fin-Inst-ID       To    FK-OAKO-FinInst-ID       07990000
           End-If                                                       08000000
      *                                                                 08010000
           Move R115IPA0-Contract-Type   To    FK-TFMC-Contr-Type       08020000
           Move R115IPA0-Contract-No     To    FK-TFMC-Contr-No         08030000
      *                                                                 08040000
           Move R115IPA0-CA-Currency     To    FK-TFCA-Currency         08050000
           Move R115IPA0-PA-Seq-No       To    TFPA-Seq-No              08060000
      *                                                                 08070000
           Move R115IPA0-Status          To    TFPA-Status              08080000
           Move R115IPA0-In-Progress     To    TFPA-In-Progress         08090000
      *                                                                 08100000
           Initialize                          R7919100-Konverter-Dato  08110000
           Set   R7919100-Versjon        To    True                     08120000
