             When R7919999-Return-OK                                    08670000
               Move  TFPA-Seq-No         To    R115IPA0-PA-Seq-No       08680000
      *                                                                 08690000
             When R7919999-Return-Error                                 08700000
               Continue                                                 08710000
      *                                                                 08720000
             When other                                                 08730000
               Move  'G201'              To    R7919999-Paragraph       08740000
               Perform Z900-Abend                                       08750000
